# What every heed film shares: the branded intro and outro (brand/), the web profile (landing page clips: small and
# muted-friendly), and a calm zoom. Each reel Imports it; where the videos go is the reel's Output and scripts/reels.sh.

Set IntroBackground //docs/reels/brand/intro.mov
Set OutroBackground //docs/reels/brand/outro.mov
Set ZoomEasing smooth
Set ZoomDuration 700ms
Set Subtitles off
Set KeyBadges on
Set Profiles web

# Landing page clips: 1440 wide, small enough to load with the page, no GIF.
Profile web
  Set VideoWidth 1440
  Set Quality 55
  Set MaxSize 8MB
  Set Formats mp4
